# Goal — report the outcome of the move just executed, then get the next directive.
# (On the first call nothing has executed yet: success defaults true, observation empty.)
bool success        # did the move just executed (plan + follow) succeed? (ignored on the first call)
string observation  # grounded VLM feedback from the execution, verbatim (the planner's path reasoning)
---
# Result — the next directive
bool mission_done    # true when the mission is complete
string description   # the next instruction to feed trajectory_planner (empty when mission_done)
string area          # the current environment (from the narrative)
string message       # the narrative's present intent (or the closing summary when done)
---
# Feedback
string state         # "RUNNING" while judging / (re)planning
